---
const currentYear = 2026;
---

<footer class="bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800 text-slate-400 text-xs">
  
  <!-- Top Query Hotline Strip (MSC Scaffolding Pattern) -->
  <div class="border-b border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/60 py-3.5 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-slate-800 text-center text-xs">
      <div class="py-1 px-3">
        <span class="text-slate-400 block text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">ESTIMASI TEKNIS</span>
        <a href="#kalkulator" class="font-bold text-slate-200 hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Hitung Kebutuhan Tiang →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="py-1 px-3">
        <span class="text-slate-400 block text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">HOTLINE RESMI</span>
        <a href="#kontak" class="font-bold text-orange-400 hover:underline">
          0851-8300-5070
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="py-1 px-3">
        <span class="text-slate-400 block text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">WILAYAH OPERASIONAL</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-200">Seluruh Indonesia</span>
      </div>
      <div class="py-1 px-3">
        <span class="text-slate-400 block text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">WORKSHOP PUSAT</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-200">Pool & Depo Terpadu</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Footer Content -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Brand & Profile -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <a href="/" class="flex flex-col group">
          <span class="font-heading text-2xl font-black tracking-widest uppercase text-white group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">
            BORPILE NUSANTARA
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs tracking-wider uppercase text-slate-400 font-semibold">
            PT. BORPILE NUSANTARA
          </span>
        </a>

        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed pr-4">
          Kontraktor terpadu spesialis rekayasa pondasi dalam: Bore Pile Hydraulic Rig, Wash Boring Mini Crane, Mini Hydraulic Dry System, Tiang Pancang Tekan HSPD bebas getaran, dan armada truk tangki vacuum sedot lumpur bergaransi resmi untuk berbagai proyek di seluruh Indonesia.
        </p>

        <!-- Plain Contact Text -->
        <div class="pt-2 text-xs space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
          <p><strong>Workshop & Depo:</strong> Kompleks Pool Alat Berat & Fabrikasi Tulangan Besi</p>
          <p><strong>Hotline Operasional:</strong> <span class="text-orange-400 font-semibold">0851-8300-5070</span> (Setiap Hari, 08:00 – 17:00 WIB)</p>
          <p><strong>Cakupan Layanan:</strong> Seluruh Wilayah Indonesia (Jawa, Sumatera, Kalimantan, Sulawesi, Bali, Nusa Tenggara)</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5 Layanan Spesialis -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Layanan Spesialis</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="#layanan" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Bore Pile Hydraulic Rig</a></li>
          <li><a href="#layanan" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Wash Boring Mini Crane</a></li>
          <li><a href="#layanan" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Bore Pile Mini Hydraulic</a></li>
          <li><a href="#layanan" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Piling HSPD (Silent Tekan)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#layanan" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Sedot Lumpur Vacuum</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Area Jangkauan Operasional Proyek -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Jangkauan Proyek</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li><span>Jawa Timur & Jawa Tengah</span></li>
          <li><span>Jabodetabek & Banten</span></li>
          <li><span>Jawa Barat & Sekitarnya</span></li>
          <li><span>Bali & Nusa Tenggara</span></li>
          <li><span>Sumatera & Kalimantan</span></li>
          <li><span>Sulawesi & Wilayah Lainnya</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Standar Teknis & Legalitas -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Standar K3 & Panduan</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li><span>Standar SNI 8460:2017 Geoteknik</span></li>
          <li><span>Fasilitas Uji PIT & PDA Bersertifikat</span></li>
          <li><span>Disposal Lumpur Berizin Resmi</span></li>
          <li><span>Kontrak SPK & Transparansi Opname</span></li>
          <li class="pt-1"><a href="/artikel/" class="text-orange-400 font-bold hover:underline">Artikel & Panduan Teknik Pondasi →</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
        Copyright © {currentYear}, PT. Borpile Nusantara. Seluruh hak cipta dilindungi undang-undang.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-xs text-slate-400">
        <a href="#top" class="hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors">Kembali ke Atas ↑</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
